16. **time_to_95p_adoption_seconds**: This might indicate the time in seconds it takes for 95% adoption of a new feature or configuration.

17. **selected_backup_pop**: This could refer to the selected backup Point of Presence (PoP), possibly as a categorical variable.

18. **health_check_interval_seconds**: This measures the interval in seconds between health checks for servers or services.

19. **observed_incident_error_rate**: This is likely the observed rate of errors during incidents, similar to incident_error_rate, but based on actual observations.

20. **ecs_present**: A binary variable indicating whether EDNS Client Subnet (ECS) is present. Values are typically 0 (absent) or 1 (present).

